# Release signing key for upgradoor, in ssh-keygen's allowed_signers format: the key that signs
# upgradoor-manifest.txt (scripts/sign-release.sh). It is the same security key as restodian's
# release key, under its own namespace: a restodian signature (namespace restodian-client) never
# verifies as an upgradoor one. CI checks a release against this file before it tags the image;
# Ansible checks against its own pinned copy, never one downloaded with the release.
# The private key stays offline with the maintainer; CI never signs.
#
# Each line: upgradoor-release namespaces="upgradoor-release" <key type> <key> [comment]
